                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/releases/tag/v9.5.1"&gt;Aspire 9.5.1 Release&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5]: Add proper launch profile support to the VS Code extension by @Copilot in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3447064252" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11617" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11617/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11617"&gt;#11617&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Cherry-pick extension build and sign pipeline setup by @Copilot in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3447065100" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11618" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11618/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11618"&gt;#11618&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix globalPackagesFolder path to be platform-agnostic in NuGetConfigMerger by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3447614843" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11626" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11626/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11626"&gt;#11626&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix flashing console windows when Docker processes are launched on Windows by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3447018226" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11615" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11615/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11615"&gt;#11615&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Display help text for GenAI sensitive data when no messages by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3455715029" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11668" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11668/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11668"&gt;#11668&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Allow .NET 10 prerelease versions for single-file apphost scenarios by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3447042023" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11616" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11616/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11616"&gt;#11616&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Update Aspire package versions from 9.5.0 to 9.5.1 by @Copilot in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3466748181" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11721" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11721/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11721"&gt;#11721&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix DevTunnels in DevContainers and Codespaces by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3467590065" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11730" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11730/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11730"&gt;#11730&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Don't require gen_ai.system attribute on span events by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3467820660" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11735" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11735/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11735"&gt;#11735&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Update Microsoft.Extensions.AI packages, use content env var by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3467109950" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11726" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11726/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11726"&gt;#11726&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix ParameterProcessor to use ExecutionContextOptions and skip excluded resources by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3474623177" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11782" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11782/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11782"&gt;#11782&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Update retry in Kusto emulator actions to handle any non-permanent error by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3474046270" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11779" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11779/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11779"&gt;#11779&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix CommandLineArgsCallbackContext ExecutionContext in AzureResourcePreparer and prevent WithVSCodeDebugSupport execution in publish mode by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3475366419" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11788" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11788/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11788"&gt;#11788&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Fix GenAI visualizer when span is missing peer attribute by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/JamesNK/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/JamesNK"&gt;@JamesNK&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3472284854" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11765" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11765/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11765"&gt;#11765&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Support parameter names with dashes resolved from underscore configuration by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3478371808" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11802" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11802/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11802"&gt;#11802&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[release/9.5] Adapt OpenAI health check based on endpoint configuration by @github-actions[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3476068220" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/issues/11792" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/aspire/pull/11792/hovercard" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/pull/11792"&gt;#11792&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/dotnet/aspire/compare/v9.5.0...v9.5.1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v9.5.0...v9.5.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
